Description: Manually curated human ovarian cancer ExpressionSet objects
    from 30 studies, with uniformly processed expression data and
    standardized clinical metadata including survival outcomes. Datasets
    are hosted on Zenodo and downloaded on first use, then cached locally
    with BiocFileCache. Includes a configurable script for rule-based
    creation of filtered dataset lists for meta-analysis.
